 "remarks": "Highest & Best due by 6pm on Friday 8/28/26! Fabulous downtown location just minutes from vibrant downtown shops, restaurants, entertainment and transit, yet tucked away on a quiet street. This freshly painted first-floor 1-bedroom condo offers comfortable space with a living room featuring sliders that open to a private patio overlooking a peaceful green space. The open kitchen is well appointed with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and a convenient breakfast bar. Bedroom includes a walk-in closet, while the updated bathroom adds a modern touch. Additional highlights include hardwood floors throughout and assigned garage parking. Enjoy the perfect blend of convenience & comfort!",
